| description = Rangers in Greater Faydark have a treetop guildhall in [[Kelethin]].  Here the Faydark's Champions train under guildmaster Maesyn Trueshot.  
These champions oppose the Crushbone Orcs wherever they can find them.  They are loyal to the Elven [[King Tearis Thex]], and support both the Clerics and Soldiers of Tunare.

